# Automatic disqualifiers

State these plainly — the agent should skip a posting the moment one of
these is true, no matter how good the rest of the match looks.

- Requires security clearance
- Requires US citizenship or US work authorization
- Requires more than 3 years of professional experience
- Title contains Staff / Principal / Director / VP / Head of
- On-site only, not in Bangalore/Hyderabad/Pune, and not remote
- Contract/temp roles under 6 months
- Unpaid or "equity only" compensation
